    "name": "FILEN-028: files uploaded into a folder by three different clients are all seen by another device with their right names",
    "description": "FILEN-028 (Filen): recipients saw 3 or 4 of 15 new files; rclone-written items showed as CANNOT_DECRYPT_NAME or not at all in the official clients. Rules I1 (one index entry format, names decrypt the same on every client), M1. sync-chaos share-links-and-revocation (the drive half).",
